  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ethiopia Joint Prog. Gender Equality &amp; Women&apos;s Empowerment- One UN Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Gender Equality and Women&#x2019;s Empowerment Joint Programme (GEWE JP) articulates the support of UN Agencies to the Government of Ethiopia (GoE) in its efforts to further improve the lives of Ethiopian women and support the realization of their rights, in line with its international commitments. The Programme will be implemented in all regions as well as at the federal level. Six UN agencies are participating in the Programme: UN Women, UNFPA, ILO, UNDP, UNESCO and and UNICEF.</narrative>
  </description>
